{
  "id": "ECC.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Ecclesiastes 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of the Preacher, the son of David, king in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanity of vanities, saith the Preacher, vanity of vanities; all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What profit hath a man of all his labour which he taketh under the sun?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "One",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "generation passeth away, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "another",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "generation cometh: but the earth abideth for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sun also ariseth, and the sun goeth down, and hasteth to his place where he arose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wind goeth toward the south, and turneth about unto the north; it whirleth about continually, and the wind returneth again according to his circuits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the rivers run into the sea; yet the sea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not full; unto the place from whence the rivers come, thither they return again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All things",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "full of labour; man cannot utter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the eye is not satisfied with seeing, nor the ear filled with hearing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thing that hath been, it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which shall be; and that which is done",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that which shall be done: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no new",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thing",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "under the sun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is there",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thing whereof it may be said, See, this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "new? it hath been already of old time, which was before us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no remembrance of former",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neither shall there be",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remembrance of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that are to come with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "those",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that shall come after.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I the Preacher was king over Israel in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I gave my heart to seek and search out by wisdom concerning all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that are done under heaven: this sore travail hath God given to the sons of man to be exercised therewith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen all the works that are done under the sun; and, behold, all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity and vexation of spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "That which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "crooked cannot be made straight: and that which is wanting cannot be numbered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I communed with mine own heart, saying, Lo, I am come to great estate, and have gotten more wisdom than all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that have been before me in Jerusalem: yea, my heart had great experience of wisdom and knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
